What the support desk knows, kept next to the code that knows it. One desk, every product:
`sched-prod` (calendar invites for about 300k people) and the rest. When something breaks, the reports land here first.

Start with [triage](/kb/triage/dedupe) if you are new on the desk.

**Current correction:** [#4471 contains two date problems](/kb/incidents/4471-split).
Use [decision 0002: merge by cause](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause) for new reports, not the historical subject-only rule.

